<view class="page">
  <view class="news-heading">
    <view class="eyebrow">官网内容 · 原文可核对</view>
    <view class="news-title">校园动态</view>
    <view class="news-meta">来源：{{source.label}}</view>
    <view class="news-meta" wx:if="{{syncedAtText !== ''}}">数据同步于 {{syncedAtText}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="news-notice">
    内容由云函数从官网同步，不是实时更新。详情页为小程序自身页面，可复制原文链接到浏览器核对。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="news-empty">
    <view class="section-title">加载中</view>
    <view class="news-empty-copy">正在从云端读取校园动态…</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}" class="news-empty">
    <view class="section-title">暂时读不到内容</view>
    <view class="news-empty-copy">{{errorMessage}}</view>
    <button id="retry-load" class="home-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="retry">重试</button>
    <button id="back-home" class="home-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{status === 'empty'}}" class="news-empty">
    <view class="section-title">暂无资讯</view>
    <view class="news-empty-copy">云端还没有已同步的条目，同步成功后文章会出现在这里。</view>
    <button id="back-home" class="home-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="news-list">
    <view
      class="news-item"
      wx:for="{{items}}"
      wx:key="id"
      hover-class="pressed"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="openDetail"
    >
      <view class="news-item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="news-item-foot">
        <text class="news-item-date">{{item.date === '' ? '日期待核实' : item.date}}</text>
        <text class="news-item-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{moreState === 'loading'}}" class="news-more">正在加载更早的资讯…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{moreState === 'error'}}" class="news-more news-more-error">
      <view class="news-more-copy">{{errorMessage}}</view>
      <button id="retry-more" class="news-more-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="retryMore">重试</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{hasMore}}" class="news-more news-more-tap" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="loadMore">上滑或点此加载更多</view>
    <view wx:else class="news-more">已经到底了</view>

    <button id="back-home" class="home-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>
</view>
